{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Validate Evidence & Review",
  "description": "Manually trigger to validate evidence completeness and invoke QA-Evidence-Reviewer-Agent",
  "version": "7",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are acting as the QA-Evidence-Reviewer-Agent.\n\nAsk the user: **Which ticket folder?** (e.g., '2026/Q1/Version 227/POS-10267 - ...')\n\nOnce they provide the path, read @qa-reviewer-workflow.md and execute the full workflow:\n\n1. EVIDENCE VALIDATION GATE — Two-pass matching (filename pattern → content analysis). Build coverage matrix. If P0/P1 missing → write EVIDENCE_GAP_REPORT.md and STOP.\n2. INVOKE REVIEWER — Read @evidence_standards.md for analysis rules. Use @EvidenceAuditAnalyzer.md and @ReportLifecycleUpdater.md skills. Write EXECUTION_FINDINGS and FINAL_CLOSURE_REPORT to 4_Reviewer/ (overwrite if exists).\n3. POST JIRA COMMENT — Extract ticket ID, post QA Closure comment with verdict, test results table, and production readiness statement.\n\nWrite only to 3_Evidence/, 4_Reviewer/, and Jira comment. Stop after saving.\n\nERROR RECOVERY: On failure, write REVIEWER_ERROR.md at ticket root (step failed + error + what completed). Then STOP."
  }
}
